

C ======================================================================
C ADVANCED PARSER FIXTURE: MCNP-LIKE NTP ENGINE INPUT
C Companion to: ntp_rocet.inp
C Target file:   ntp_mcnp.inp
C
C Purpose:
C   Non-operational neutronics / radiation-transport companion deck for
C   the ntp-sys-console visualization and parser baseline.  The geometry
C   mirrors the ROCETS-like engine network: LH2 tank outlet, boost pump,
C   main turbopump, regenerative jacket, spin-state conditioning, reactor
C   package, turbine tap, thrust chamber, and bell nozzle.
C
C Posture:
C   - Synthetic parser fixture only.
C   - No validated criticality, shielding, performance, or design claim.
C   - No KCODE criticality run is defined; this is a fixed-source deck.
C   - Values are compact demonstration numbers for import testing.
C
C Advanced mapping included from ntp_rocet.inp:
C   - internal_shield heat-leak / dose proxy
C   - six-group point-kinetics counterpart comments
C   - iodine/xenon restart-memory proxy metadata
C   - reflector gamma-heating tally proxy
C   - control drums and auxiliary poison bank regions
C   - three axial fueled regions plus six azimuthal channel sectors
C   - Ledinegg/channel-instability switch mapping comments
C   - turbine branch, mixer, chamber, nozzle, and thrust proxy tallies
C ======================================================================

